WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:10.593
The Lino Spiteri Foundation 
works very closely

00:00:10.618 --> 00:00:13.101
through the national employment agency, 
Jobsplus,

00:00:13.528 --> 00:00:15.000
to support local enterprises

00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:18.041
in the recruitment 
of people with a disability

00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:26.771
They helped me search for work 
and attend appointments.

00:00:26.858 --> 00:00:28.313
Last year we were looking for staff

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.596
to help us in the cleaning of our restaurant

00:00:30.621 --> 00:00:34.332
and we came across services offered 
by the Lino Spiteri Foundation.

00:00:34.357 --> 00:00:38.055
The job needs to be tailor-made 
to fit into the individual's abilities.

00:00:38.653 --> 00:00:40.632
They helped me a lot in this process

00:00:40.657 --> 00:00:43.404
from interviewing 
to find the right candidate,

00:00:43.429 --> 00:00:45.457
for the skills for the job.

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:48.240
So once the individual 
is chosen for employment

00:00:48.265 --> 00:00:51.558
the job coach can guide 
the person to employment

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.342
until the person is independent.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.451
They come during the week

00:00:55.476 --> 00:00:56.861
to see how they are doing

00:00:56.886 --> 00:00:59.889
if we need to help them
 in something else, in training.

00:00:59.914 --> 00:01:06.110
Everyone helped me to learn the job

00:01:06.135 --> 00:01:10.462
and explained the work done here.

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:14.480
I learnt well and I can help people.

00:01:16.883 --> 00:01:18.632
We are happy to contribute because

00:01:18.657 --> 00:01:21.139
we believe that people with special needs

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:24.113
have also skills and can help the company.

00:01:25.059 --> 00:01:31.753
I have a good boss, I have other colleagues

00:01:31.778 --> 00:01:34.745
and I made a lot of friends.

00:01:35.324 --> 00:01:38.507
They are really friendly

00:01:38.532 --> 00:01:43.457
and as I respect them, 
they respect me as well.

